# Derived artifacts.
#
# These are committed on purpose: `bin/ci` verifies each one still matches its
# source, and the daemon embeds the conversation bundle with `include_str!`. But
# they are never merged by hand. Git is told to leave a conflict here rather
# than interleave two regenerated blobs, and the resolution is always to run
# `bin/regenerate` -- which rebuilds them in dependency order, since each is
# generated from the one above it.
openapi/fleetd-v1.json              -merge
clients/typescript/src/generated/** -merge linguist-generated
web/conversation/conversation.js    -merge linguist-generated
web/conversation/conversation.css   -merge linguist-generated
web/conversation/index.html         -merge linguist-generated
web/conversation/contract.json      -merge linguist-generated

# Lockfiles are resolved by re-resolving, not by choosing lines.
Cargo.lock                          -merge
package-lock.json                   -merge
